OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABank of England expected to raise
OL,4,Ainterest rates for first time in more
OL,5,Athan three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe war in Iran has been a driver
OL,8,Fbehind higher energy costs - Faisal
OL,9,FIslam writes that the Bank's economists
OL,10,Fhave been weighing how long the
OL,11,Fconflict will last
OL,13,FThe Bank uses interest rates as a tool
OL,14,Fto help slow inflation - which is
OL,15,Fcurrently at 3.5%, above the Bank's 2%
OL,16,Ftarget - by making borrowing more
OL,17,Fexpensive
